{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/915885527/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1743350693000,"content":"<p>1. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.frbsf.org/research-and-insights/publications/working-papers/2025/01/explaining-stagnation-in-the-college-wage-premium/\" target=\"_blank\">Our results suggest that the recent stagnation of the college wage premium primarily reflects demand factors, specifically a slowdown in the pace of skill biased technological change.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://thezvi.substack.com/p/gemini-25-is-the-new-sota?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=573100&amp;post_id=160014258&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">The Zvi on Gemini 2.5</a>.  I agree it is very strong.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://m.rediff.com/broadband/2000/sep/12trans.htm\" target=\"_blank\">Very old interview with Hrishikesh Mukherjee</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FBWQsxr-CXo\" target=\"_blank\">Does Boulez still matter?</a> A good talk, too bad the speaker doesn’t like Boulez’s best works!</p>\r\n<p>5. “Already, Russia is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/economy/trade/trade-war-explodes-across-world-at-pace-not-seen-in-decades-0b6d6513?mod=article_inline\" target=\"_blank\">starting to push back</a> against a flood of cheap Chinese imports. It has introduced tariffs on some Chinese goods and raised recycling fees on imported cars, effectively raising the price of vehicles from China.”  <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/business/china-companies-us-tariffs-market-reliance-c0bba4b0\" target=\"_blank\">WSJ link</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-024-01506-4\" target=\"_blank\">The economic costs of wind erosion?</a></p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y7VtSK23_Jg\" target=\"_blank\">Chess 2.0 overcomes the cost disease?</a></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/sunday-assorted-links-510.html\">Sunday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/915885527/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/915885527/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/915885527/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/915885527/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/915885527/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/915885527/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/sunday-assorted-links-510.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/sunday-assorted-links-510.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsr